    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34774" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναιωρ-έομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>float</i> or <i>drift about in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλάσσῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					700
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>to be always in motion</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμοὶ ἐναιωρεύμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prog.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρα ἐνῃωρημένα</span>
			<i>containing suspended matter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ούμεναι συστάσεις</span>
			<i>movable</i> concretions, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.88
			</span></i>.</div>
